WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.593 --> 00:00:16.180
The of Black Rain sat on a cliff, holding his head in his hands.

2
00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:18.681
He stared down.

3
00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:25.885
"Hello, Demon of Black Rain," a fiend said, walking up the cliff.

4
00:00:27.786 --> 00:00:28.486
"What's wrong?"

5
00:00:29.327 --> 00:00:30.147
The demon sighed.

6
00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:36.659
"I was preparing a nice dinner when Sun Wukong suddenly attacked me.

7
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.841
I had to flee from my mountain!"

8
00:00:41.402 --> 00:00:42.563
The fiend shook his head.

9
00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:46.025
"Why would you let Sun Wukong bully you like that?"

10
00:00:47.646 --> 00:00:49.187
The demon looked up in surprise.

11
00:00:49.207 --> 00:00:52.530
"Sun Wukong is really powerful!"

12
00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:55.732
"Bah!" The fiend waved his hand.

13
00:00:55.752 --> 00:00:59.214
"You shouldn't have to flee from your own mountain."

14
00:01:00.795 --> 00:01:01.596
The demon nodded.

15
00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:07.183
"I wouldn't let Sun Wukong bully me," the fiend said.

16
00:01:08.284 --> 00:01:09.425
The demon made a fist.

17
00:01:09.445 --> 00:01:11.867
"Me neither!"

18
00:01:11.887 --> 00:01:15.430
"Where is our friend?"

19
00:01:16.611 --> 00:01:18.412
Wukong glared at Swift Wing.

20
00:01:19.413 --> 00:01:20.774
He raised his iron bar.

21
00:01:22.596 --> 00:01:23.897
Swift Wing looked frightened.

22
00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:26.018
"He's in another world!"

23
00:01:27.279 --> 00:01:28.540
Wukong lowered his bar.

24
00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:30.582
"Another world?"

25
00:01:30.602 --> 00:01:32.964
"How did he get there?"

26
00:01:33.288 --> 00:01:34.289
the Tang Monk asked.

27
00:01:34.309 --> 00:01:38.092
"I opened a portal," Swift Wing said.

28
00:01:38.112 --> 00:01:42.135
"Your friend tried to fight the Demon of Black Rain.

29
00:01:42.476 --> 00:01:45.038
But he tripped and fell through the portal."

30
00:01:45.058 --> 00:01:49.261
"I'm confused," Wukong said.

31
00:01:49.281 --> 00:01:51.903
"Why did you open a portal to another world?"

32
00:01:51.923 --> 00:01:57.067
"The Demon of Black Rain made me do it," Swift Wing said.

33
00:01:57.087 --> 00:02:02.652
"A powerful goddess lives in the other world, and the demon wants her help."

34
00:02:03.848 --> 00:02:04.868
"How can she help him?"

35
00:02:05.148 --> 00:02:06.249
the Tang Monk asked.

36
00:02:07.709 --> 00:02:08.809
Swift Wing looked down.

37
00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:13.511
"She could, um, defeat Wukong."

38
00:02:17.552 --> 00:02:19.213
Wukong cried, making a fist.

39
00:02:19.233 --> 00:02:21.213
"Nobody can defeat me!

40
00:02:21.653 --> 00:02:24.414
If I ever meet that goddess, I'll destroy her!"

41
00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:28.755
"Don't worry about the goddess, Wukong," the Tang Monk said.

42
00:02:28.775 --> 00:02:34.508
"We must find Bajie."

43
00:02:34.528 --> 00:02:34.968
"You're right."

44
00:02:36.329 --> 00:02:37.749
Wukong looked at Swift Wing.

45
00:02:38.549 --> 00:02:39.910
"Tell me how to open that portal."

46
00:02:42.891 --> 00:02:44.972
Swift Wing explained the spell to Wukong.

47
00:02:47.492 --> 00:02:52.214
As soon as she was done, Wukong raised his iron bar, and Swift Wing backed away.

48
00:02:52.234 --> 00:02:55.675
"Wukong, what are you doing?"

49
00:02:56.035 --> 00:02:56.915
the Tang Monk said.

50
00:02:56.935 --> 00:02:58.276
"She helped us."

51
00:03:02.336 --> 00:03:05.499
"She's a demon, Master, so I have to destroy her," Wukong said.

52
00:03:05.519 --> 00:03:08.701
"I'm sorry," Swift Wing said.

53
00:03:08.722 --> 00:03:12.605
"I used to be a regular bird, but then the demon captured me.

54
00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:14.326
He turned me evil!"

55
00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:20.832
Wukong sighed and lowered his iron bar.

56
00:03:20.852 --> 00:03:26.016
"If you really want to be good again, go to Mount Potalaka."

57
00:03:27.277 --> 00:03:29.119
"To the bodhisattva Guanyin?"

58
00:03:29.499 --> 00:03:30.340
Swift Wing asked.

59
00:03:31.424 --> 00:03:32.205
Wukong nodded.

60
00:03:32.225 --> 00:03:35.867
"Become Guanyin's student, and she will teach you to be good."

61
00:03:38.689 --> 00:03:39.590
Swift Wing bowed.

62
00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:41.211
"I will do that."

63
00:03:43.953 --> 00:03:46.034
The bird demon flapped her wings and flew off.

64
00:03:50.838 --> 00:03:55.701
Wukong recited the spell, and the portal opened, revealing a city filled with tall buildings.

65
00:03:56.842 --> 00:03:58.543
The Tang Monk's eyes went wide.

66
00:03:58.563 --> 00:04:03.357
"Wow!" "You two wait here," Wukong said.

67
00:04:03.377 --> 00:04:05.917
"I'll find Bajie as quickly as I can.

68
00:04:06.598 --> 00:04:08.298
Then we'll continue our journey."

69
00:04:10.159 --> 00:04:13.920
Wukong jumped through the portal, which closed behind him.

70
00:04:18.481 --> 00:04:19.682
The Tang Monk sat down.

71
00:04:19.702 --> 00:04:23.863
"You look tired, Master," Wujing said.

72
00:04:23.883 --> 00:04:27.124
"Take a nap while I go outside and check on the horse."

73
00:04:31.052 --> 00:04:33.653
The Tang Monk closed his eyes but soon heard footsteps.

74
00:04:38.275 --> 00:04:39.296
you back already, Wujing?"

75
00:04:40.016 --> 00:04:41.997
He opened his eyes—and screamed.

76
00:04:44.378 --> 00:04:45.978
The Demon of Black Rain grinned.

77
00:04:45.999 --> 00:04:48.960
"Hello again, Tang Monk!"
